  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A three year project on reducing the impact of the Hiv/Aids in Moldova will be implemented and co-ordinated by AFEW. A communication platform with representatives from governmental organisations, civil society, media and international organisations will be created to facilitate co-operation among key stakeholders from different sectors for a clear and unified approach to communication on Hiv/Aids in MDA.</narrative>
